;ENGINEERED RESIDUE IN CHAIN A, CYS 37 TO LEU
ENGINEERED RESIDUE IN CHAIN A, CYS 442 TO ALA
ENGINEERED RESIDUE IN CHAIN B, CYS 37 TO LEU
ENGINEERED RESIDUE IN CHAIN B, CYS 442 TO ALA

 CATALYZES C14-DEMETHYLATION OF LANOSTEROL,
 24,25-DIHYDROLANOSTEROL AND OBTUSIFOLIOL WHICH IS
 NECESSARY FOR ERGOSTEROL BIOSYNTHESIS.
 IT TRANSFORMS LANOSTEROL INTO 4,4'-DIMETHYL
 CHOLESTA-8,14,24-TRIENE-3-BETA-OL.
 ITS PRECISE BIOLOGICAL SUBSTRATE IS NOT KNOWN.
;
